<h3 id="top-bar">Top bar</h3>
<p>
	The available areas depend on your <a href="#woondershop-skins">skin</a>. <b>Default and Jungle</b> have Top Left and Top Right. <b>Fab</b> has Top Bar. <b>Haven</b> has Top Left, Top Right, and Top Bar, plus Middle Left and Middle Right.
</p>
<p>
	Add widgets to these areas in <b>Appearance &rarr; Widgets</b>.
</p>
<p>
	Adjust top bar visibility and colors in <b>Appearance &rarr; Customize &rarr; Header &rarr; Top Bar Area</b>. Haven also has a <b>Middle Bar Area</b> section. Controls vary by skin.
</p>
